mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/67a098047f5b9a900df6d5662e9e607f.poster.avif?t=1768948554\" width=1170 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/67a098047f5b9a900df6d5662e9e607f.webm?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/67a098047f5b9a900df6d5662e9e607f.mp4?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Genesis, pistols have also become customizable.. You can now equip attachments such as suppressors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bullet you carry, every med kit you take, and every grenade you choose shapes the decisions you will make during the mission. Your gear determines the rhythm of the firefight; define how far you can push, when you need to take risks, and when you need to fall back. With Contain: Genesis, our armory has expanded even further with more weapons and new parts to modify them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/c93ae128180b133d984e91214fac69ef.poster.avif?t=1768948554\" width=1170 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/c93ae128180b133d984e91214fac69ef.webm?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/c93ae128180b133d984e91214fac69ef.mp4?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP GAMEPLAY</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play Contain solo or form a Fire Team with up to 5 people. Role distribution within the team, synchronized movement, and clear communication play a critical role in completing missions successfully. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is zero margin for error. Friendly fire, communication breakdowns, or poor positioning can result in the entire team being wiped out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your team well and practice in the renewed Training Area beforehand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/d1437fb55663f167c70b2d95ee00ff77.poster.avif?t=1768948554\" width=1170 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/d1437fb55663f167c70b2d95ee00ff77.webm?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/extras/d1437fb55663f167c70b2d95ee00ff77.mp4?t=1768948554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GET READY, OPERATOR. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE DROP ZONE IS SET, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TARGETS MARKED. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME TO CONTAIN THE UNKNOWN.</p>","developers":["SinginGiant"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186700/e8413ae6a1174d08dbfa35cc3a9632b4a2f6fb8b/header.jpg?t=1768948554","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2186700/21277923